  "name": "Dungeon Spoils give body armor of the best armor class the opener can wear",
  "contract": [
    "Ascension (CoA changelog 2025-03-31): \"Caches/Spoils Armor Type acquisition based on proficiencies of",
    "classes improved.\" Dungeon Spoils (2021814) drop cloth, leather and mail body armor (head, shoulders, chest,",
    "wrists, hands, waist, legs, feet) for an opener who can wear plate; cloaks, shields, jewelry and weapons stay",
    "in the pool. A level 44 Warrior who knows Plate Mail opens ten spoils and gets no cloth, leather or mail body",
    "armor. About 3 in 10 items of the pool the Warrior can use at level 41-44 are lower armor, so without the",
    "armor class rule ten opens give one in about 97 runs out of 100."
